sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Mac / SQL client
    participant S as Snowflake
    participant E as Microsoft Entra ID
    participant P as Power BI

    Note over C,P: VERIFIED · Trial test · Python runs on the Mac
    C->>S: Request signed statement
    S-->>C: Signed statement
    C->>E: Present signed statement
    E-->>C: Power BI access token
    C->>P: List workspaces with access token
    P-->>C: HTTP 200 · one workspace

    Note over C,P: UNTESTED · Full setup · Python runs inside Snowflake
    C->>S: Call SQL procedure
    S->>S: Sign statement
    S->>E: Present signed statement
    E-->>S: Power BI access token
    S->>P: List workspaces with access token
    P-->>S: Workspace page
    S-->>C: Return workspace page
